{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37352","headline":"秋霁丰德寺与玄贞师咏月 · 唐彦谦","name":"秋霁丰德寺与玄贞师咏月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露冷风轻霁魄圆，高楼更在碧山巅。\n四溟水合疑无地，八月槎通好上天。\n黯黯星辰环紫极，喧喧朝市匝青烟。\n夜深独与岩僧语，羣动消声举世眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}